<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;See the section "Streaming Output" in my node [id://1180578|here], in particular [mod://IPC::Run] might be useful to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;for mysterious reasons _sometimes_ ... it waits forever even when $system_command finishes&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It might be useful to debug that, since it's possible that it's the fault of the program you're calling ([http://perl.plover.com/FAQs/Buffering.html|suffering from buffering] maybe?), and/or that the other modules will suffer from exactly the same problem.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
